Stanton, Perry: Much as I hate to break up a good fight :-), especially
one I helped start, the argument over whether the Jains constitute a
"culture" in the srict technical sense is irrelevant.

Let's recall my original challenge to Perry: find me a pure-vegan culture
living above 40 degrees north latitude in pre-industrial conditions.

